  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The poor child who is off school because the parents cannot pay for school fees who have the opportunity to go back to school and be happy. Your donation would make it possible for those children  to have better and brighter future. Many children are orphans in Nigeria because of killings and unrest in the country. The school is the only place of refuge for them.</narrative>
